<!-- ============ 3. Solutions ============ -->
<section class="sec" id="solutions" aria-labelledby="sol-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head sec-head--split rv">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Solutions</p>
        <h2 class="h2" id="sol-title">Same platform. Different pressure points.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="sec-head__lead">A data center team and a regulated bank don't lose sleep over the same things. Pick yours.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sol" data-sol>
      <div class="sol__sel" role="tablist" aria-label="Environments">
        <button role="tab" type="button" class="selr" id="tab-dc" aria-controls="pan-dc" aria-selected="true"><span class="selr__n mono">01</span><span class="selr__name">Data Center</span><span class="selr__hook">Growth that outpaces power and people</span><span class="selr__bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span></button>
        <button role="tab" type="button" class="selr" id="tab-ent" aria-controls="pan-ent" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span class="selr__n mono">02</span><span class="selr__name">Enterprise IT</span><span class="selr__hook">Tooling that piled up over the years</span><span class="selr__bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span></button>
        <button role="tab" type="button" class="selr" id="tab-reg" aria-controls="pan-reg" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span class="selr__n mono">03</span><span class="selr__name">Regulated</span><span class="selr__hook">Every change has to be provable</span><span class="selr__bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span></button>
        <button role="tab" type="button" class="selr" id="tab-edge" aria-controls="pan-edge" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span class="selr__n mono">04</span><span class="selr__name">Edge</span><span class="selr__hook">Remote sites nobody can see</span><span class="selr__bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span></button>
      </div>

      <div class="solp is-on" role="tabpanel" id="pan-dc" aria-labelledby="tab-dc">
        <div class="solp__left">
          <p class="solp__intro">Compute, storage, networking and tenant environments keep growing. Power, cost and capacity don't.</p>
          <div class="ba" data-ba>
            <div class="ba__side ba__before"><p class="mono">The challenge</p><p>Teams react to issues across several consoles, so finding the cause takes longer than fixing it.</p></div>
            <div class="ba__side ba__after"><p class="mono">What Synaptix<sup class="tm">&#8482;</sup> does</p><p>Management, monitoring, usage visibility and AI-assisted investigation in one place, with health shown in context.</p></div>
            <span class="ba__handle" role="slider" tabindex="0" aria-label="Reveal what Synaptix does" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="10" data-cursor="Drag"><span></span></span>
          </div>
          <ul class="outs">
            <li><span class="outs__ic"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-layers"/></svg></span><strong>Less</strong><span>operational complexity</span></li>
            <li><span class="outs__ic"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-eye"/></svg></span><strong>More</strong><span>infrastructure visibility</span></li>
            <li><span class="outs__ic"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-server"/></svg></span><strong>Better</strong><span>use of resources</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="viz viz--rack">
          <div class="viz__top"><p class="mono">Rack view</p><span class="tag-ill">Illustrative</span></div>
          <div class="racks" data-racks></div>
          <p class="viz__tip mono" data-rack-tip aria-live="polite">Hover or tap a server to inspect it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="solp" role="tabpanel" id="pan-ent" aria-labelledby="tab-ent" hidden>
        <div class="solp__left">
          <p class="solp__intro">Years of virtualization and tooling have piled up. Licensing keeps rising and nobody owns the whole picture.</p>
          <div class="ba" data-ba>
            <div class="ba__side ba__before"><p class="mono">The challenge</p><p>Management is split across systems and teams, and every renewal deepens the dependence on one vendor.</p></div>
            <div class="ba__side ba__after"><p class="mono">What Synaptix<sup class="tm">&#8482;</sup> does</p><p>One environment for private and hybrid infrastructure, a phased way off legacy virtualization, and operational data that stays yours.</p></div>
            <span class="ba__handle" role="slider" tabindex="0" aria-label="Reveal what Synaptix does" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="10" data-cursor="Drag"><span></span></span>
          </div>
          <ul class="outs">
            <li><span class="outs__ic"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-layers"/></svg></span><strong>Less</strong><span>platform dependence</span></li>
            <li><span class="outs__ic"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-pulse"/></svg></span><strong>Less</strong><span>operational overhead</span></li>
            <li><span class="outs__ic"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg></span><strong>More</strong><span>infrastructure control</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="viz viz--org">
          <div class="viz__top"><p class="mono">Ownership map</p><span class="tag-ill">Illustrative</span></div>
          <svg class="org" viewBox="0 0 360 250" data-org aria-hidden="true">
            <g class="org__links">
              <path data-l="infra" d="M180 52V88H70V118"/><path data-l="net" d="M180 52V118"/><path data-l="apps" d="M180 52V88H290V118"/>
              <path data-l="site1" d="M70 150V178H40V198"/><path data-l="site2" d="M70 150V178H110V198"/><path data-l="hybrid" d="M290 150V198"/>
            </g>
            <g class="org__n is-root"><rect x="120" y="20" width="120" height="32" rx="3"/><text x="180" y="41">Synaptix&#8482;</text></g>
            <g class="org__n" data-b="infra" data-p="infra"><rect x="20" y="118" width="100" height="32" rx="3"/><text x="70" y="139">Infra team</text></g>
            <g class="org__n" data-b="net" data-p="net"><rect x="130" y="118" width="100" height="32" rx="3"/><text x="180" y="139">Network</text></g>
            <g class="org__n" data-b="apps" data-p="apps"><rect x="240" y="118" width="100" height="32" rx="3"/><text x="290" y="139">App owners</text></g>
            <g class="org__n is-leaf" data-b="site1" data-p="infra site1"><rect x="6" y="198" width="68" height="30" rx="3"/><text x="40" y="218">Site 1</text></g>
            <g class="org__n is-leaf" data-b="site2" data-p="infra site2"><rect x="80" y="198" width="68" height="30" rx="3"/><text x="114" y="218">Site 2</text></g>
            <g class="org__n is-leaf" data-b="hybrid" data-p="apps hybrid"><rect x="250" y="198" width="80" height="30" rx="3"/><text x="290" y="218">Hybrid</text></g>
          </svg>
          <p class="viz__tip mono" data-org-tip>Hover a branch to trace who owns what.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="solp" role="tabpanel" id="pan-reg" aria-labelledby="tab-reg" hidden>
        <div class="solp__left">
          <p class="solp__intro">When an auditor asks who changed what and why, "check the other tool" isn't an answer.</p>
          <div class="ba" data-ba>
            <div class="ba__side ba__before"><p class="mono">The challenge</p><p>Access rules and change history live in different places, so proving control takes days of gathering.</p></div>
            <div class="ba__side ba__after"><p class="mono">What Synaptix<sup class="tm">&#8482;</sup> does</p><p>Role-based access, an audit trail on every change and policy-driven workflows, all on infrastructure you run privately.</p></div>
            <span class="ba__handle" role="slider" tabindex="0" aria-label="Reveal what Synaptix does" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="10" data-cursor="Drag"><span></span></span>
          </div>
          <ul class="outs">
            <li><span class="outs__ic"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-lock"/></svg></span><strong>Role-based</strong><span>access control</span></li>
            <li><span class="outs__ic"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-check"/></svg></span><strong>Every change</strong><span>in the audit trail</span></li>
            <li><span class="outs__ic"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-server"/></svg></span><strong>Private</strong><span>infrastructure operations</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="viz viz--log">
          <div class="viz__top"><p class="mono">Audit log · live</p><span class="tag-ill">Illustrative</span></div>
          <ul class="alog" data-alog></ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="solp" role="tabpanel" id="pan-edge" aria-labelledby="tab-edge" hidden>
        <div class="solp__left">
          <p class="solp__intro">Remote sites usually get the least attention and the oldest tooling.</p>
          <div class="ba" data-ba>
            <div class="ba__side ba__before"><p class="mono">The challenge</p><p>Every distributed site ends up with its own tools, and problems surface late because nobody can see them.</p></div>
            <div class="ba__side ba__after"><p class="mono">What Synaptix<sup class="tm">&#8482;</sup> does</p><p>The same visibility and management at the edge as in the core. Cross-site coordination comes with Multi-Site Management, which is in development.</p></div>
            <span class="ba__handle" role="slider" tabindex="0" aria-label="Reveal what Synaptix does" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="10" data-cursor="Drag"><span></span></span>
          </div>
          <ul class="outs">
            <li><span class="outs__ic"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-layers"/></svg></span><strong>One</strong><span>toolset for every site</span></li>
            <li><span class="outs__ic"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-eye"/></svg></span><strong>Visible</strong><span>remote sites</span></li>
            <li><span class="outs__ic"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-network"/></svg></span><strong>Central</strong><span>management</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="viz viz--edge">
          <div class="viz__top"><p class="mono">Distributed sites</p><span class="tag-ill">Illustrative</span></div>
          <svg class="edgemap" viewBox="0 0 360 250" data-edge aria-hidden="true">
