      <div class="cmp__row"><p class="cmp__k">Consoles to manage</p><p class="cmp__v"><svg class="ic ic-a"><use href="#i-x"/></svg><svg class="ic ic-b"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span class="a">One per domain, four or more</span><span class="b">One</span></p></div>
      <div class="cmp__row"><p class="cmp__k">Where visibility lives</p><p class="cmp__v"><svg class="ic ic-a"><use href="#i-x"/></svg><svg class="ic ic-b"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span class="a">Spread across separate monitoring tools</span><span class="b">Health, metrics, logs and state in one view</span></p></div>
      <div class="cmp__row"><p class="cmp__k">How investigations run</p><p class="cmp__v"><svg class="ic ic-a"><use href="#i-x"/></svg><svg class="ic ic-b"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span class="a">By hand, tab by tab</span><span class="b">AI correlates the data and points to a likely cause</span></p></div>
      <div class="cmp__row"><p class="cmp__k">Admin interfaces to learn</p><p class="cmp__v"><svg class="ic ic-a"><use href="#i-x"/></svg><svg class="ic ic-b"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span class="a">One for each vendor</span><span class="b">One, with APIs for automation</span></p></div>
      <div class="cmp__row"><p class="cmp__k">How processes are documented</p><p class="cmp__v"><svg class="ic ic-a"><use href="#i-x"/></svg><svg class="ic ic-b"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span class="a">Wikis, tickets and memory</span><span class="b">Central workflows and an audit trail</span></p></div>
      <div class="cmp__row"><p class="cmp__k">Licensing exposure</p><p class="cmp__v"><svg class="ic ic-a"><use href="#i-x"/></svg><svg class="ic ic-b"><use href="#i-check"/></svg><span class="a">Tied to one legacy virtualization vendor</span><span class="b">Open foundation and a phased path off it</span></p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="bento">
