        <span class="pillar__ic"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-spark"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Integrated AI operations</h3>
        <p>The AI isn't bolted on. It runs inside the operating environment, so it already knows your hosts, networks and storage when you ask it something.</p>
        <p class="pillar__more">Ask "why is this slow?" and it reads the same metrics, logs and state your operators would, in seconds instead of tabs.</p>
