        <p>Compute, networking, storage and monitoring through one connected layer.</p>
        <p class="pillar__more">Provision, change and roll back from one screen, with one set of permissions.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="pillar rv">
        <span class="pillar__ic"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-server"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Proven foundation</h3>
        <p>Established infrastructure technologies sit underneath, so you modernize without a ground-up rebuild.</p>
