      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 6. Oversight demo ============ -->
<section class="sec sec--dark" id="oversight" aria-labelledby="ov-title">
  <div class="wrap ov">
    <div class="ov__copy rv">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark">Operator oversight</p>
      <h2 class="h2" id="ov-title">The AI recommends. You decide.</h2>
      <p>Every AI action goes through the same loop. It investigates, plans and recommends. Then it stops and waits for a person.</p>
      <p>Pick an incident, watch the steps, and make the call yourself. Approve or reject, the decision lands in the audit trail.</p>
      <ul class="ov__legend">
        <li><span class="mono">01</span>Investigate</li><li><span class="mono">02</span>Plan</li><li><span class="mono">03</span>Recommend</li><li><span class="mono">04</span>Your call</li>
      </ul>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn--line btn--dark" data-ov-reset><span>Run it again</span></button>
    </div>

    <div class="ovc" data-ov>
      <div class="ovc__tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Incident scenarios">
        <button type="button" role="tab" id="ovt-0" aria-controls="ovc-body" aria-selected="true" data-ov-s="0">Storage latency on cluster B</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" id="ovt-1" aria-controls="ovc-body" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-ov-s="1">Host near memory limit</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" id="ovt-2" aria-controls="ovc-body" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-ov-s="2">Unplanned config change</button>
      </div>
      <div class="ovc__body" id="ovc-body" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ovt-0">
        <div class="ovc__top"><p class="mono" data-ov-title>Incident</p><span class="tag-ill">Illustrative</span></div>
        <div class="ovc__flow">
          <span class="ovc__rail" aria-hidden="true"><i data-ov-rail></i></span>
          <ol class="ovc__steps">
